Subject: [PATCH v5 08/19] dt-bindings: usb: xhci: Add Broadcom STB v2 compatible device
Date:   Sat, 5 Dec 2020 18:24:15 +0300
Message-ID: <20201205152427.29537-9-Sergey.Semin@baikalelectronics.ru>
